{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentKey","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You can create custom environment values by extending the ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentValues"},{"text":" structure with new properties.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"First declare a new environment key type and specify a value for the required defaultValue property:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["private struct MyEnvironmentKey: EnvironmentKey {","    static let defaultValue: String = \"Default value\"","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Then use the key to define a new environment value property:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["extension EnvironmentValues {","    var myCustomValue: String {","        get { self[MyEnvironmentKey.self] }","        set { self[MyEnvironmentKey.self] = newValue }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Clients of your environment value never use the key directly. Instead, they use the key path of your","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"custom environment value property. To set the environment value for a view and all its subviews,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"add the ","type":"text"},{"code":"View\/environment(_:_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view modifier to that view:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["MyView()","   .environment(\\.myCustomValue, \"Another string\")"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To read the value from inside MyView or one of its descendants, use the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Environment","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property wrapper:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["struct MyView: View {","    @Environment(\\.myCustomValue) var customValue: String","","    var body: some View {","        Text(customValue) \/\/ Displays \"Another string\".","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"protocol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"protocol"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentKey"}],"title":"EnvironmentKey","externalID":"s:8AdaUtils14EnvironmentKeyP","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EnvironmentKey"}],"roleHeading":"Protocol","modules":[{"name":"AdaUtils"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A key for accessing values in the environment."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adautils\/environmentkey"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils"]]},"topicSections":[{"title":"Associated Types","generated":true,"anchor":"Associated-Types","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/Value"]},{"title":"Type Properties","generated":true,"anchor":"Type-Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey\/defaultValue"]}],"references":{"doc://AdaUtils/documentation/AdaUtils/EnvironmentKey":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"EnvironmentKey","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaUtils\/documentation\/AdaUtils\/EnvironmentKey","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/adautils\/environmentkey","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnvironmentKey","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnvironmentKey","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A key for